    <statement><p>Let <m>f(x)=x^{2}-8x+8</m>.</p>
<p>Find the critical point <m>c</m> of <m>f(x)</m> and compute <m>f(c)</m>.</p>
<p>The critical point <m>c</m> is =  <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>The value of <m>f(c)</m> =  <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p>Compute the value of <m>f(x)</m> at the endpoints of the interval <m>[0,8]</m>.</p>
<p><m>f(0)</m> =  <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
<p><m>f(8)</m> =  <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0004"/></p>
<p>Determine the min and max of <m>f(x)</m> on <m>[0,8]</m>.</p>
<p>Minimum value =  <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0005"/></p>
<p>Maximum value =  <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0006"/></p>
<p>Find the extreme values of <m>f(x)</m> on <m>[0,1]</m>.</p>
<p>Minimum value =  <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0007"/></p>
<p>Maximum value =  <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0008"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>4</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
